    <solution><p>To change a percentage to a decimal, we move the decimal to the left twice.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 8\% = {0.08} }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 80\% = {0.8} }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 100\% = 1 }</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{ 800\% = {8} }</m></p>
</solution>
